          "content": "## Scheduler Sweep\nEvery 5 minutes the database decides what is due (ava.sweep): approval checkpoints and expiries (timers pause in quiet hours), 24h and 1h call reminders, finished calls, idle conversations. This workflow only carries it out: client messages, conversation summaries, and owner alerts that are now due, including the ones held overnight.",
